{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Speed Rivals</i> is a fast-paced slot car racing game where timing and control are crucial. In this demo, you can:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Race on <strong>4 unique tracks</strong>, each designed to test your reflexes and mastery of speed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from <strong>over 30 distinct cars</strong>, each with its own style and handling.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience gameplay focused on <strong>acceleration and deceleration</strong>, without braking or lane switching.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your experience with <strong>3 distinct camera views</strong> and adjustable settings to suit your preferences.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo offers a glimpse into the core mechanics of <i>Speed Rivals</i>. Additional tracks and content will be added <strong>for free</strong> during the demo period.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3719310?t=1747169713","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3719310?t=1747169713","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719310/575d7a82b9eff0a4dde7f23b3e5ea630e93aa160/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747169713","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719310/575d7a82b9eff0a4dde7f23b3e5ea630e93aa160/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747169713","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Speed Rivals</i> is a fast-paced slot car racing game where timing and control are crucial. In this demo, you can:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Race on <strong>4 unique tracks</strong>, each des